$ https://www.innoludic.com/2015-04-30-13-56-29/thermometers/56-rules-of-thermometers.html

$ Orientation: therms[X,Y] is indexed [column, row] by the model, so this matrix is
$ written column by column; grid[r,c] is the page's row r, column c.  (Before
$ 2026-10-11 this param was the page puzzle transposed.)

letting width be 6
letting height be 6
letting step be 10
letting thermcount be 9


letting therms be [
    [ 5, 25, 35, 45, 53, 72],
    [ 4, 24, 34, 44, 52, 71],
    [ 3, 23, 33, 43, 51, 84],
    [ 2, 22, 32, 42, 61, 83],
    [ 1, 21, 31, 41, 62, 82],
    [11, 12, 13, 14, 63, 81]
]

letting row_sums be [4,1,5,5,3,2]
letting col_sums be [1,3,4,3,4,5]
